Z||000018||EdsB52||08-10-2001||06:28 PM|||| <A HREF="http://navigation.helper.realnames.com/framer/1/112/default.asp?realname=RootsWeb&url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww%2Erootsweb%2Ecom%2F&frameid=1&providerid=112&uid=30003615" TARGET=_blank>http://navigation.helper.realnames.com/framer/1/112/default.asp?realname=RootsWeb&url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww%2Erootsweb%2Ecom%2F&frameid=1&providerid=112&uid=30003615</A> <P>This is a good one, especially to find dead people. Hit the Social Security Death Index prompt. I haven't investigated other sources on this site, just that one.||||reg||1
