Z||000021||EdsB52||08-12-2001||07:10 AM||||Cool, hope it panned out in that you didn't find anything. And you might have to play with the function of the site for a bit. For instance, if you want to find Dana Plato of Diff'rent Strokes, you'll need to type in "D Plato." But I believe Elvis Presley is fully spelled. You can get the SSAN's and request a copy of the original SSAN card filing if you wish. When I looked, a couple years ago, I found the older brother of a kid I went to elementary school with that had deceased a couple years prior to that. He actually broke into our house the fncker. Good riddance. I've found a boss from the AF that I heard had his wife hire someone to off him. You can do soundex if you don't have the exact spelling, or do advanced search if you need to narrow the search due to common last name. Punch in "Dick Head" and get a laugh. Some bastard was given that name and passes it on to their kid.....and people in here think I'm a fncker! Anyway, tell me if you found anything.||||reg||1
